#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House7/scripts.inc:12
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House7_Text_CityFromEruptedVolcano"
msgid ""
"An underwater volcano erupted and\n"
"forced itself up from the depths.\p"
"Its crater emerged from the sea and\n"
"became filled with rainwater.\p"
"That's how SOOTOPOLIS CITY came into\n"
"being.$"
msgstr ""
"一座海底火山爆发，\n"
"从深海中隆起。\p"
"它的火山口露出海面，\n"
"积满了雨水。\p"
"琉璃市就是这样诞生的。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House7/scripts.inc:20
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House7_Text_CaveMadeToKeepSomething"
msgid ""
"The cave that links SOOTOPOLIS and\n"
"the outside world…\p"
"It seems as if the cave was made to\n"
"keep something from getting out.\p"
"Or am I just imagining things?$"
msgstr ""
"连接琉璃市和外面世界的洞窟……\p"
"那个洞窟好像是为了\n"
"不让什么东西跑出去而造的。\p"
"还是说，只是我想多了？$"
